5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"We need to be realistic about our staffing. I'll look into administrator retirements and hiring times, and depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to know if the new stuff will actually work in the yard! I'm picking yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial, and the depot calendar.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am interested in the long-term costs. I will check the board minutes on capital and operating requests and five years of renewal invoices.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm worried about things breaking and plans changing. I'll take support ownership during last winter's outage and warehouse rule changes after new accounts.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'll focus on technical debt and external failures. I'll examine the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
