50,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Looking at the candidates, Anchor Industrial Software seems best because their engineers stay through the rollout.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Anchor sounds good for the yard, but Meridian's hosted suite might be easier on our calendar.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Meridian's fixed configuration and hosted model align with the board's preference for stable operating costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"Meridian offers a regional service team, which solves the support ownership issue. I like them.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Corvus is too modular, and Tessera relies on a partner for migration. Meridian is the most logical, stable choice.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, would Meridian's fixed configuration be too rigid for the depot supervisors?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, maybe, but Anchor's on-site team is a huge plus for the actual rollout.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Kenji, but Anchor puts the system on our own servers. That means we handle the upgrades we've been skipping.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"That's a great point, Toshio. We can't afford to let the system age in place again.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. Meridian's hosted model removes the upgrade burden from our depleted admin staff.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I see the risk now. If we can't maintain it, the on-site rollout doesn't matter. I'll shift to Meridian.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm worried about the ""fixed configuration"" part, but if it's hosted, it's better than a crash. I'm in for Meridian.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Meridian is the safest financial and operational bet.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm happy with Meridian. It's the most cohesive package.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,It seems we have a consensus. Meridian is the rational choice.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
